# The search over Home opened and closed, nothing typed (the Android app's SearchMotionTest: search-open, then
# search-close): the list pulled down to its field, the field tapped (up to the top as 取消 comes in), a pause, then
# 取消 (the field back into the list).
timeout 20000
until 整理发布清单
wait 600
drag 195 300 0 300 300
wait 900
tap 搜索全部内容
wait 1000
tap 取消
wait 1000
